<title>UK: Vickers half year pretax rises 18 percent.</title>
<headline>Vickers half year pretax rises 18 percent.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ending June 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		6.3		    vs 5.5</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 2.7		    vs 2.4</p>
<p> Pretax		     31.8		   vs 27.0</p>
<p> Turnover		   553.8		  vs 501.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts' forecasts on pre-tax profits were in a range of 29.0 to 41.0 million stg.  </p>
<p> Operating profit	 31.4		   vs 25.3</p>
<p> Interest received	0.4		    vs 1.2</p>
<p> Tax			  10.5		   vs 8.8</p>
<p> Net taxed		  21.3		   vs 18.2</p>
<p> Retained profit	  12.0		   vs 10.1</p>
<p> Pay date		   October 16</p>
<p>Div registration date  September 24  Ex-div date		September 16</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 5427717</p>
</text>
